  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-25T16:16:38.477Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So you find a nice world and favorite it and the world  updates with new content but how do you know other than a discord group or twitter account or other such place outside of vrchat for updates?\n\nThe main worlds we want to know that are updated are those we favorite so how about an icon on the thumbnail say a green up arrow in a corner when it gets updated from our last visit.\n\nHow can this be done? Its simple,  on your favorite list of worlds include a new data field with each world.  Last visited.  When you open the menu and the worlds are loaded if the  latest update date on a world in your favorites list is greater than when you last visit date then it shows the icon.  When you next visit the world it updates the last visited date later than the update date and the icon stops been shown.  Simple.",
